Genome Annotation Builder

This product implements the public .genome/1.1 format published by
genome.computer. The upstream specification and schema remain the work of
their respective authors and are retrieved at a pinned revision with checksum
verification; they are not modified silently by this project.

The vendored ACMG Secondary Findings/ClinGen policy snapshot and the separate
ClinGen gene-disease validity/dosage-sensitivity snapshot contain curated
content obtained from the Clinical Genome Resource (ClinGen) on 2026-08-15.
ClinGen releases curated content under CC0 1.0 and requests attribution and the
date accessed. Source and policy identifiers are recorded in resource
manifests; no ClinGen logo is redistributed.

Optional third-party prediction databases are not included in this source
distribution or licensed under this project's Apache-2.0 licence. The pipeline
can locally acquire checksum-pinned releases after the operator reviews their
terms. The recorded conservative boundaries are: LOFTEE source under MIT while
redistribution terms for its ancillary GRCh38 data are not stated; CADD v1.7
for non-commercial use unless separately licensed; REVEL for academic/non-
commercial use with redistribution not granted by the recorded source;
AlphaMissense under the exact hosted file's CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 notice (stricter
than the upstream repository's CC BY 4.0 statement); and Ensembl/upstream
SpliceAI terms requiring an independent redistribution review. Generated
bundles reference resource digests and terms but never embed these databases.
